tions in this gene have been associated with geroderma osteodysplastica. Alternatively spliced transcript variants have been described. [provided by RefSeq, Mar 2009].","ncbi_source":"NCBI Gene summary (RefSeq), via MyGene.info","uniprot_function":[{"accession":"Q5T7V8","text":"Plays a role in the organization and function of the Golgi apparatus. Involved in protein post-translational modification, particularly glycosylation of extracellular matrix proteins. Functions at the trans-Golgi by cooperating with SCYL1 to promote COPI coat assembly into discrete functional domains, supporting Golgi organization and trafficking."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}